38,"s":26,"a":207,"sd":null},{"k":"26:208","t":"And We did not destroy any city except that it had warners","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":208,"sd":null},{"k":"26:209","t":"As a reminder; and never have We been unjust.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":209,"sd":null},{"k":"26:210","t":"And the devils have not brought it [i.e., the revelation] down.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":210,"sd":null},{"k":"26:211","t":"It is not allowable for them, nor would they be able.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":211,"sd":null},{"k":"26:212","t":"Indeed they, from [its] hearing, are removed.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":212,"sd":null},{"k":"26:213","t":"So do not invoke with Allāh another deity and [thus] be among the punished.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":213,"sd":null},{"k":"26:214","t":"And warn, [O Muḥammad], your closest kindred.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":214,"sd":null},{"k":"26:215","t":"And lower your wing [i.e., show kindness] to those who follow you of the believers.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":215,"sd":null},{"k":"26:216","t":"And if they disobey you, then say, \"Indeed, I am disassociated from what you are doing.\"","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":216,"sd":null},{"k":"26:217","t":"And rely upon the Exalted in Might, the Merciful,","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":217,"sd":null},{"k":"26:218","t":"Who sees you when you arise","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":218,"sd":null},{"k":"26:219","t":"And your movement among those who prostrate.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":219,"sd":null},{"k":"26:220","t":"Indeed, He is the Hearing, the Knowing.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":220,"sd":null},{"k":"26:221","t":"Shall I inform you upon whom the devils descend?","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":221,"sd":null},{"k":"26:222","t":"They descend upon every sinful liar.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":222,"sd":null},{"k":"26:223","t":"They pass on what is heard, and most of them are liars.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":223,"sd":null},{"k":"26:224","t":"And the poets - [only] the deviators follow them;","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":224,"sd":null},{"k":"26:225","t":"Do you not see that in every valley they roam","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":225,"sd":null},{"k":"26:226","t":"And that they say what they do not do? -","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":226,"sd":null},{"k":"26:227","t":"Except those [poets] who believe and do righteous deeds and remember Allāh often and defend [the Muslims] after they were wronged. And those who have wronged are going to know to what [kind of] return they will be returned.","j":19,"h":38,"s":26,"a":227,"sd":null}],"juz":19,"hizb":38,"surahs":[26],"sajdah":false}